# =============================================================================
# StyloMail runtime state — never commit live mail, spools or profiles
# =============================================================================
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
# Anchored, and deliberately so. Unanchored, `profiles/` also matched
# src/StyloMail.Adaptive/Profiles/ and silently excluded eight source files from
# the repository, so every commit up to and including 3aee47a failed to build
# from a fresh clone with CS0234/CS0246. Runtime state is written under a data
# root, so match that and keep the root-level form for a host started at the
# repository root. Never re-add a bare `profiles/` here.
**/data/spool/
**/data/profiles/
**/data/quarantine/
/spool/
/profiles/
/quarantine/
*.eml
!tests/**/fixtures/**/*.eml

# Python bytecode (the mutation harness is Python)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# =============================================================================
# OS / editor cruft
# =============================================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
ux-results/
ux-screenshots/

# The fleet's working directory: missions, checkpoints, the bus and the issue list.
# Kept on disk and out of the repository, because it is the agents' scratch rather
# than the project.
#
# A GAP, NOT A DECISION: spec.md and architecture.md are the design of record and live
# here, so untracking this took them out of the repository with everything else. They
# belong in docs/ if the design should be public.
.styloagent/
